# Candidate summary — S016342

Added `src/include/uapi/linux/psample.rs` with immutable provenance for the
pinned UAPI header. The final source provides all 18 packet-sample attributes
(including its sentinel), all 4 generic-netlink commands, all 18 tunnel-key
attributes (including its sentinel), the derived maximum attribute expression,
and all four UAPI macros. The two named C enum tags are distinct transparent
`i32` wrappers; every unscoped enumerator remains an `i32` constant expression.
The three string-literal macros are by-value `[u8; N]` arrays with their
terminating NUL, not references or statics. It adds no tests, runtime behavior,
driver code, or shared module index changes.
